  "releaseNotes": "- Added Spoiler, Timeline and Skeleton components.\n\t\t\t- Added live Spanish and English control localization, preserving values, selections and explicit labels.\n\t\t\t- Added filled form fields, consistent control sizing and Filled/Outlined button variants.\n\t\t\t- Improved grid filters, alignment, responsive panels, lists and component showcases.\n\t\t\t- Added optional application text localization callbacks for open dialogs and toasts.\n\t\t\t- Targets .NET 11 RC2.",
